    - Name: text
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Kiwis live in New Zealand\u2019s forests, grasslands, and scrublands.
        They prefer dense vegetation for cover and soft soil for digging. These birds
        make burrows or use natural shelters to hide during the day, emerging at
        night to forage for insects and worms."
